-- Decision (2026-11-16, Avik: "there will be no file system (asap)"; "all steps no questions"): the
-- code and the documents are the source, objects of store/ (src/store.c, lib/host.cub h-source), and
-- no file holds them; git carries store/ until a served store does. A commit may hold store/'s
-- objects, the two files the tools around the work read from the disk (CLAUDE.md, README.md), and
-- g-frozen; a .cub or .md file anywhere else is refused. The core changes so that the machine reads
-- each module and document from the source (src/syntax.c src_text, record_source; src/lang.c
-- load_file, --ingest, --record, the machine run as hyperactive or as the pre-commit hook; src/store.c
-- source_dir); ./hyperactive and .githooks/pre-commit become links to the machine.
g-allowed : List Word → List Word → Bool
g-allowed p h = if h-prefix "store/" p then true else if orB (h-eq p "CLAUDE.md") (h-eq p "README.md") then true else g-member p h g-frozen
